      "abstract": "In this paper, we employ the modified simple equation method to find the exact traveling wave solutions involving parameters of nonlinear evolution equations via the (1+1)dimensional generalized shallow water-wave equation and the(2+1)-dimensional KdV-Burgers equation. When these parameters are taken to be special values, the solitary wave solutions are derived from the exact traveling wave solutions. It is shown that the proposed method provides a more powerful mathematical tool for constructing exact traveling wave solutions for many other nonlinear evolution equations.",
